Materials— \(\mathrm{[12\alpha-^{3}H]}\) Digoxin (15.0 Ci/mmol), \(\mathrm{[^{3}H(G)]}\) daunorubicin \((4.3\,\mathrm{\Ci/mmol})\) and \([N\!\cdot\) -methyl- \(\mathrm{^{3}H}]\) morphine (86.5 Ci/mmol) were obtained from NEN Life Science Products. [MeBMT- \(\beta\) - \(\mathrm{^{3}H}]\) cyclosporin A (6.6 Ci/mmol), \([1,2,4,6,7-^{3}\mathrm{H}]\) dexamethasone (87 Ci/mmol), and minif \(\mathrm{^{3}C}\) /carboxylic acid \((M_{\mathrm{r}}\) approximately 5200) \((5.95\,\mathrm{\mCi/mmol})\) were from Amersham Pharmacia Biotech. \(\mathrm{[^{3}H]}\) paclitaxel \((11.6\,\mathrm{Ci/mmol})\) was from Moravek Biochemical Inc. (La Brea, CA). \(\mathrm{[^{14}C]}\) SDZ PSC 833 was a gift from Novartis Pharma Inc. (Basel, Switzerland). [22,23- \(\mathrm{^{3}H}]\) ivermectin \((51.9\;\mathrm{mCi/mmol})\) was kindly provided by Merck. 1-Hexadecanoyl-2- \(\mathrm{C_{6}}\) -(7-nitro-2,1,3-benzoxadiazol-4-yl)-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine \(\mathrm{C_{8}}\) -NBD-PC) and \(\mathrm{C_{6}}\) -NBD-phosphatidic acid \(\mathrm{C_{6}}\) -NBD-PA) were from Avanti (Alabaster, AL). \(\mathrm{C_{8}}\) -NBD-ceramide was from Molecular Probes, Inc. (Eugene, OR). \([\alpha-^{32}\mathrm{P}]8\) -azido-ATP \((666\,\mathrm{\GBq/mmol})\) and \([\alpha-^{32}\mathrm{P}]\) ATP (111 TBq/mmol) were obtained from ICN Biomedicals (Costa Mesa, CA) All tissue culture materials were from Life Technologies, Inc. Other chemicals were from Sigma.

